Having:
Having clause is used to specify conditions like where clause
but it allways use with group by command
We cannot use where command with group by

Main difference btw where and having:
Where clause is used for filtering the rows while having clause is used for filtering groups
Where clause does not work with aggregate functions while we can use having clause with aggregate functions
Where claused can used before the group by clause but not after that
We can use where and having clause together in a single query
From the performance point of view having is slower than where and should be avoided when possible
