Cube:
Cube is a aggregate operate that produce a super aggregate row.
The summary row is displayed for every possible combination of groups in the result set.
e.g
SELECT gender, SUM(salary) AS total_salary
FROM users
GROUP BY CUBE(gender);



RollUp:
To get subtotals and grand totals, you can use ROLLUP 

 SELECT a.gender, SUM(a.salary) AS total_salary,b.city
 FROM users a inner join addresses b on a.id=b.user_id
 GROUP BY gender,city with rollup;                 
                                                    


